# {{TITLE}} notes

A private, write-only store. Notes accumulate here as a by-product of ordinary work.

- **Not a git repo, no remote.** Nothing here is published.
- **The assistant writes, never reads.** Duplicates are yours to merge.
- **No automatic promotion.** Moving a note into any published library is your manual
  step, and the assistant will decline to do it even if asked.

One markdown file per insight, numbered in capture order. `INDEX.md` lists them.

`CANDIDATES.md` is a shortlist, not a queue: notes whose kind has the shape of a
publishable principle are copied there as a line for you to review. Nothing is
moved, and a note appearing there is a suggestion to read it, not a decision.

